      "description": "输入框、讨论范围、发送；片段只展示视觉，不发送消息。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-conversation-composer\"><div class=\"ds-composer-input-row\"><textarea aria-label=\"自由讨论\" placeholder=\"问问你的项目，或说说现在的想法…\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></div><div class=\"ds-composer-toolbar\"><label class=\"ds-composer-label\"><select aria-label=\"讨论范围\"><option>全部项目</option><option>片段</option></select></label><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-primary ds-composer-send\">发送<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20V4m-6 6 6-6 6 6\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-conversation-composer{font-family:var(--body,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#302820);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.ds-conversation-composer :where(button,input,textarea,select){font:inherit;color:inherit}:is(.ds-conversation-composer,.ds-composer-input-row,.ds-composer-toolbar,.ds-composer-label,.ds-primary,.ds-composer-send):is(button){border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}:is(.ds-conversation-composer,.ds-composer-input-row,.ds-composer-toolbar,.ds-composer-label,.ds-primary,.ds-composer-send):is(button):disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}:is(.ds-conversation-composer,.ds-composer-input-row,.ds-composer-toolbar,.ds-composer-label,.ds-primary,.ds-composer-send):is(button):hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}:is(.ds-conversation-composer,.ds-composer-input-row,.ds-composer-toolbar,.ds-composer-label,.ds-primary,.ds-composer-send):is(button,summary,input,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a35c36);outline-offset:5px}.ds-conversation-composer{padding:17px 20px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#ded5c9);border-radius:16px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--surface,#fffcf7) 90%,transparent);box-shadow:0 10px 32px #50261105}.ds-conversation-composer:focus-within{border-color:var(--focus,#a35c36);box-shadow:0 5px 25px var(--glow,#d1894d24)}.ds-composer-input-row{display:flex;gap:14px}.ds-conversation-composer textarea{display:block;flex:1;width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:45px;max-height:130px;resize:none;border:0;background:transparent;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;padding:0}.ds-conversation-composer textarea:focus{outline:none}.ds-composer-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:7px}.ds-composer-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#75695f)}.ds-composer-label select{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#75695f);font-size:12px;padding:6px 22px 6px 0;max-width:160px;min-height:34px;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;background:var(--accent,#8a432b);color:var(--on-accent,#fff9f0);border-radius:8px;padding:11px 17px;min-height:42px;font-size:13px}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#8a432b) 88%,var(--ink,#302820));color:var(--on-accent,#fff9f0)}.ds-primary:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(.98)}.ds-composer-send{font-size:12px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 13px}.ds-conversation-composer{box-shadow:none}.ds-conversation-composer textarea{font-family:var(--body,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#302820)}.ds-composer-send svg{width:14px;height:14px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-conversation-composer textarea::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#75695f)}.ds-composer-label select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a35c36);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:620px){.ds-conversation-composer{padding:15px 16px 11px}.ds-conversation-composer textarea{font-size:16px;min-height:44px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "按需辅助导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "项目文字入口与设置、暂停、明暗小图标。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-topbar-actions\" aria-label=\"辅助入口\"><button class=\"ds-topbar-projects\" type=\"button\">项目</button><button class=\"ds-icon-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"设置\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 17h16M8 4v6M16 14v6\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-icon-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"暂停炉火动效\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5v14M15 5v14\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-icon-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"切换明暗主题\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 15.5A8 8 0 0 1 8.5 5 8 8 0 1 0 19 15.5Z\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-topbar-actions{font-family:var(--body,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#302820);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.ds-topbar-actions :where(button,input,textarea,select){font:inherit;color:inherit}:is(.ds-topbar-actions,.ds-topbar-projects,.ds-icon-button):is(button){border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}:is(.ds-topbar-actions,.ds-topbar-projects,.ds-icon-button):is(button):disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}:is(.ds-topbar-actions,.ds-topbar-projects,.ds-icon-button):is(button):hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}:is(.ds-topbar-actions,.ds-topbar-projects,.ds-icon-button):is(button,summary,input,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a35c36);outline-offset:5px}.ds-topbar-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.ds-topbar-projects{padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#75695f);border-radius:5px;min-height:36px}.ds-topbar-projects:hover,.ds-icon-button:hover{background:var(--wash,#eee3d4)}.ds-topbar-projects[aria-current=page]{color:var(--ink,#302820)}.ds-icon-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;color:var(--muted,#75695f)}.ds-icon-button svg{width:17px;height:17px}.ds-icon-button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--wash,#eee3d4);color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}.ds-icon-button svg{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "轻量建议",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "suggestion",
      "description": "实际建议是文字按钮，不是药丸标签。",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-suggestion-chip\">有哪些项目值得继续？</button>",
      "css": ".ds-suggestion-chip{font-family:var(--body,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#302820);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.ds-suggestion-chip :where(button,input,textarea,select){font:inherit;color:inherit}:is(.ds-suggestion-chip):is(button){border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}:is(.ds-suggestion-chip):is(button):disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}:is(.ds-suggestion-chip):is(button):hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}:is(.ds-suggestion-chip):is(button,summary,input,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a35c36);outline-offset:5px}.ds-suggestion-chip{padding:7px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#75695f)}.ds-suggestion-chip:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "项目记忆折页",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "memory-fold",
      "description": "原生 details 可展开；合成旧记录、材料和未知部分同时保留。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-memory-fold\"><summary aria-label=\"展开片段的项目旧记录\"><span class=\"ds-memory-fragment\"><span class=\"ds-memory-origin\">片段<time>2025.02</time></span><q>读到好内容时，先留下来。</q></span><svg class=\"ds-memory-toggle\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"ds-memory-unfolded\"><p>读到好内容时，先留下来。过一阵子，再让它回到眼前。</p><dl><div><dt>留下的材料</dt><dd>摘录组件、交互草图、README</dd></div><div><dt>仍需你补充</dt><dd>原型资料没有记录你当时为何停下。</dd></div></dl><small>合成档案 · 日期为示例记录，不代表已读取真实项目</small></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-memory-fold{font-family:var(--body,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#302820);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.ds-memory-fold :where(button,input,textarea,select){font:inherit;color:inherit}:is(.ds-memory-fold,.ds-memory-fragment,.ds-memory-origin,.ds-memory-toggle,.ds-memory-unfolded):is(button){border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}:is(.ds-memory-fold,.ds-memory-fragment,.ds-memory-origin,.ds-memory-toggle,.ds-memory-unfolded):is(button):disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}:is(.ds-memory-fold,.ds-memory-fragment,.ds-memory-origin,.ds-memory-toggle,.ds-memory-unfolded):is(button):hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}:is(.ds-memory-fold,.ds-memory-fragment,.ds-memory-origin,.ds-memory-toggle,.ds-memory-unfolded):is(button,summary,input,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a35c36);outline-offset:5px}.ds-memory-fold{width:fit-content;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto 15px;color:var(--muted,#75695f)}.ds-memory-fold summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 0}.ds-memory-fold summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-memory-fragment{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:4px 12px}.ds-memory-origin{display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:11px}.ds-memory-origin time{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-memory-origin>span{display:none}.ds-memory-fragment q{font:500 13px/1.8 var(--title,ContinuationSerif,'Songti SC',serif);quotes:'“' '”'}.ds-memory-toggle{width:10px;height:10px}.ds-memory-fold[open] .ds-memory-toggle{transform:rotate(90deg)}.ds-memory-unfolded{max-width:520px;color:var(--ink,#302820);padding:15px 0}.ds-memory-unfolded>p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9}.ds-memory-unfolded dl{margin:12px 0}.ds-memory-unfolded dl>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:80px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;margin:9px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.ds-memory-unfolded dt{color:var(--muted,#75695f)}.ds-memory-unfolded dd{margin:0}.ds-memory-unfolded small{display:block;color:var(--muted,#75695f);font-size:11px;line-height:1.8}.ds-memory-toggle{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-memory-unfolded p{margin:0}.ds-memory-unfolded dd{margin:0}@media(max-width:620px){.ds-memory-fragment q{font-size:12px}.ds-memory-unfolded dl>div{grid-template-columns:72px minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "档案页边线索",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "note-sheet",
      "description": "纸页色块表达辅助判断，不使用玻璃或装饰投影。",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-note-sheet\"><h2>留在页边的线索</h2><p>给「片段」一个更小的起点。</p><span class=\"ds-note-source\">示例判断 · 有待你的回应</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-primary\">接着聊</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-text-button\">先放一放</button></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-note-sheet{font-family:var(--body,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#302820);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.ds-note-sheet :where(button,input,textarea,select){font:inherit;color:inherit}:is(.ds-note-sheet,.ds-note-source,.ds-primary,.ds-text-button):is(button){border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}:is(.ds-note-sheet,.ds-note-source,.ds-primary,.ds-text-button):is(button):disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}:is(.ds-note-sheet,.ds-note-source,.ds-primary,.ds-text-button):is(button):hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}:is(.ds-note-sheet,.ds-note-source,.ds-primary,.ds-text-button):is(button,summary,input,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a35c36);outline-offset:5px}.ds-text-button{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#75695f);padding:8px 0;min-height:36px}.ds-text-button:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.ds-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;background:var(--accent,#8a432b);color:var(--on-accent,#fff9f0);border-radius:8px;padding:11px 17px;min-height:42px;font-size:13px}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent,#8a432b) 88%,var(--ink,#302820));color:var(--on-accent,#fff9f0)}.ds-primary:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(.98)}.ds-note-sheet{align-self:start;padding:24px;background:var(--note,#f2e6d7);color:var(--note-ink,#694e3b);margin-top:22px;border-radius:6px}.ds-note-sheet h2{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:18px}.ds-note-sheet p{font:500 19px/1.8 var(--title,ContinuationSerif,'Songti SC',serif);margin-bottom:20px}.ds-note-source{display:block;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:22px}.ds-note-sheet .ds-text-button{display:block;margin-top:9px}.ds-note-sheet h2{font-weight:500;margin-top:0}.ds-note-sheet p{margin-top:0}.ds-note-sheet{max-width:340px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "目录演示输入",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "directory-input",
      "description": "paper 底色、细边界、可见焦点；不授予文件访问。",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-directory-input\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"示例目录路径\" placeholder=\"例如 /Projects/ideas\" maxlength=\"200\" autocomplete=\"off\">",
      "css": ".ds-directory-input{font-family:var(--body,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#302820);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.ds-directory-input :where(button,input,textarea,select){font:inherit;color:inherit}:is(.ds-directory-input):is(button){border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,color 160ms}:is(.ds-directory-input):is(button):disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}:is(.ds-directory-input):is(button):hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}:is(.ds-directory-input):is(button,summary,input,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#a35c36);outline-offset:5px}.ds-directory-input{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line,#ded5c9);border-radius:5px;background:var(--paper,#f6f2eb);color:var(--ink,#302820);height:44px;padding:10px 12px;caret-color:var(--accent,#8a432b)}.ds-directory-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#75695f);opacity:1}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "毛玻璃后的炉心",
    "overview": "一处持续有生命力的炉火，接住被搁置项目的下一次对话。暖纸、深褐墨与铜橙构成日间，深色延续为暗炉室；火藏在无边框毛玻璃扩散层后，文字始终最清楚。\n\n这是 prototypes/08-living-hearth 的已实现视觉记录，依据 PRODUCT.md 与炉火方向合同提取；它是独立合成资料原型，不代表正式前后端已迁移。自然简短的对话保持低密度，项目、资料、设置按需进入，长谈时火收至顶部。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "暖纸与暗炉室沿用同一信息层级。",
      "无边框毛玻璃只扩散火层，不模糊文字。",
      "系统字体负责阅读，品牌与少量旧记录保留衬线辨识。",
      "动效可暂停、可降级，不承担产品状态证明。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Foreground Rule",
        "body": "文字与对话是清楚的前景；火只能经过无边框扩散层显现，不增加玻璃卡框。",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Honest Fire Rule",
        "body": "火势不代表项目评分、进度、研究成果或真实后台运行；重要含义必须有明确文字。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Rule",
        "body": "正文与对话使用系统字体，ContinuationSerif 只承担旧念头、档案标题等有限层级。",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保留单列对话、低权重旧记录及按需展开的资料入口。",
      "Do 使用语义色变量切换暖纸与暗炉室，保持可见焦点和中文状态文案。",
      "Do 在长谈时将火收至顶部，让消息独立滚动、输入框落底。",
      "Do 保留暂停、减少动态效果、页面隐藏静帧与无 WebGL 图像降级。",
      "Do 引用现有纹理时保留 assets/SOURCE.md 的可核查来源。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 让毛玻璃覆盖文本，或为火层加可见边框、玻璃卡片。",
      "Don't 将火改成进度、评分、后台活动证明或养成奖励。",
      "Don't 添加常驻侧栏、仪表盘、未经请求的新功能或另一套皮肤。",
      "Don't 把合成示例回复、CSS 静态状态或 snapshot 字段当作真实研究、性能或用户实验结果。"
    ]
  }
}
